{
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose you won't believe in",
                "what I have to say, will you?"
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's really there, in the recesses.",
                "You should see it for yourself."
            ]
        },
        "282_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A monster consumed by information!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The intensity of these attacks really ",
                "make it feel like an <i$extra> incident started."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heh heh heh, I'm starting to",
                "have fun here!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This's still very lukewarm.",
                "Isn't there anyone stronger?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My, aren't you feisty."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's such a ruffian like you",
                "doing in the Petrified Forest?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ruffian... Huh?",
                "Am I a ruffian?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I saw you mercilessly",
                "scattering those fairies."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's unmistakably the kind",
                "of vandalism of a ruffian."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmmm, that's not good."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Somehow, when I hold this Incident Stone,",
                "I get overconfident."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I guess it can't be helped, since it's infused",
                "with the power of that yakuza..."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you're a yakuza, huh."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yakuza are members of",
                "the forces of darkness!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am a new breed of fighter,",
                "born to oppose them."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let my power of truth be your warning.",
                "Now sever your ties with the forces of darkness, the <i$deep state>!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's that!",
                "I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "N-no way... Are you saying",
                "the truth was defeated by a yakuza...?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who're you calling",
                "a yakuza, you moron..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, wait, that's not it, this whole \"yakuza\"",
                "came from this Incident Stone's power."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm just a commoner full of curiosity,",
                "trying to get to the bottom of this stone's mystery."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The truth is seized by force,",
                "and the weak have no truth."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That yakuza I met told me this."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's foolish!"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, thanks to that fool,",
                "I realized somethin'."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Incident Stone reacts sensitively to",
                "every kind of abnormalities an incident can bring."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All your \"truths\" feel exactly like those abnormalities!",
                "In other words, they're not true at all!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wh-what are you saying!?"
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then, the world I believed in..."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What about the New World Order?",
                "Or the Reptilians?"
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Where is the Zoltaxian",
                "I believed in?"
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't go believing in that stuff!"
            ]
        }
    }
}